{"nodes": [{"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_qcf_manual_po_plan", "label": "GEMS QCF to Manual PO Implementation Plan", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_waiting_manual_po_milestone", "label": "WAITING_MANUAL_PO milestone (26)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GEMS previously had no stable post-CL resting state because Auto PO advanced rows straight to 20; milestone 26 is terminal because the PO is keyed into SAP by hand and nothing writes po_number back, so these rows never reach 'PO Published'."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_manual_po_kill_switch", "label": "GEMS_MANUAL_PO_FLOW kill switch", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Section 2a", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A single env var was chosen over config_autopo (read by the external import-pr cron, unverifiable risk) and over a feature_flags table (too much machinery for a one-month pilot); it fails closed, is read at approval time not snapshotted, and must be set in both the app and cron environments or the halves disagree silently."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_qcf_workflow_policy", "label": "qcfWorkflowPolicy centralized GEMS policy helper", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every predicate takes rows loaded from the database, never request-body fields, and returns {allowed, code, message} so callers can map denials to 403 versus 409; GEMS behavior was previously only a side effect of seeded configuration."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_qcf_library_sub_category_id_migration", "label": "qcf_library.sub_category_id migration and backfill", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Backfill runs before the FK so pre-existing orphans do not break the constraint; ON DELETE SET NULL is chosen over RESTRICT/CASCADE so deleting a category cannot block or destroy QCF history, deliberately diverging from the FK-less rfq_library precedent."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_authorization_hardening", "label": "Phase 3 authorization hardening", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 3", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kept ungated by the kill switch because reverting the fixes would reintroduce security holes; the broken CL ownership filter (scalar cl_id versus an expected {user_id, role} object) let any authenticated role reach CL approval logic."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_branch_approve_by_cl", "label": "GEMS branch in approveByCL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Skips syncAutoPO, the Management token and the Management email; the approval transaction commits before SMTP so a failed notification returns HTTP 200 with notification.status=failed rather than rolling back a valid approval. findExpiredManagementReviewItems must exclude GEMS or the rows get swept into Management expiry processing."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_build_gems_manual_po_recipients", "label": "buildGemsManualPoRecipients resolver", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If To is empty after resolution the send is skipped and logged rather than inventing placeholder addresses; a shared normalizeEmailRecipients dedupes To/Cc case-insensitively for all callers."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_manual_po_email_template", "label": "gems-qcf-approved-manual-po email template", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 5", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Must contain no approval action, Management request or Management recipient; the summary-table mapping is extracted from approval-for-quotation-summary.js into a shared partial rather than duplicated."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_inflight_gems_qcf_backlog", "label": "In-flight GEMS QCF backlog stranding risk", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Section 3a", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "8 GEMS rows sit at milestone 18 awaiting Management; once Management is blocked nobody can move them because CL cannot re-approve and the new path only fires at approval time. Mitigation: deploy with the flag off, let Management drain the backlog, verify the count is zero, then flip the flag - no data migration needed."}, {"id": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_dashboard_status_waiting_manual_po", "label": "DASHBOARD_STATUS.WAITING_MANUAL_PO mapping", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 4", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The seven role-scoped label maps must stay permanent even after rollback, because rows that reached milestone 26 during the pilot still exist and would otherwise render as an unknown status; the flag gates transitions, not interpretation."}], "edges": [{"source": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_qcf_manual_po_plan", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_backend_contract_answers_backend_contract_answers", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Section 8 Correction owed to the Frontend team", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_qcf_manual_po_plan", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_backend_contract_answers_cs_token_access", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Section 8 reverses E1/E4 Do not build a CS token flow", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_qcf_manual_po_plan", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_feature_qcf_library_insertions_qcf_library_insertions", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source_location": "Phase 6 Documentation", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "aigen_backend_docs_gems_qcf_manual_po_planning_gems_qcf_manual_po_plan", "target": "aigen_backend_docs_manual_sourcing_manual_sourcing_flow_manual_sourcing_flow", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "aigen-backend/docs/gems-qcf-manual-po/planning.md", "source